  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 3.9,
      "text": "Online shopping today consists of relentless searching, price comparison websites,"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.26,
      "e": 8.12,
      "text": "size charts and hundreds of different tabs. But what if it could be different?"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.42,
      "e": 12.96,
      "text": "The shopping cart, the basket, and if you think about it hasn't really changed in"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.96,
      "e": 17.74,
      "text": "the 30 years that e-commerce has been a thing, what should the shopping cart look like in 2026?"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.06,
      "e": 22.36,
      "text": "This is Lex and for the last 20 years he's been building companies non-stop."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.68,
      "e": 26.52,
      "text": "From selling Chinese tech at school lunches to pitching on the UK's version of Shark Tank,"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.52,
      "e": 31.5,
      "text": "he's built dozens of startups, raised millions in capital and exited multiple businesses."
    },
    {
      "s": 32.06,
      "e": 35.5,
      "text": "And now Lex is on a mission to change the shopping industry forever."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.86,
      "e": 42.78,
      "text": "Wanted is a shopping super app for the fashion space which allows you to save anything from"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.78,
      "e": 47.58,
      "text": "anywhere to one place. We'll let you know when things drop in price and go on sale."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.8,
      "e": 52.5,
      "text": "You can virtually try on all these clothes and traditionally that's been hard because to solve"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.5,
      "e": 58.44,
      "text": "fix certain things you need to have the team raise money commit to it for a year or two at least"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.44,
      "e": 63.18,
      "text": "to find out whether you might be right. So then I discovered loveable and that just changed the"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.18,
      "e": 69.52,
      "text": "game. And at first Lex's engineers were skeptical. There was a feeling of reluctance and fear."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.76,
      "e": 76.58,
      "text": "I then gave them time to explore it themselves that led to curiosity which led to enthusiasm"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.1,
      "e": 82.98,
      "text": "which led to creativity ultimately and real excitement. We launched Wanted what about three"
    },
    {
      "s": 82.98,
      "e": 89.72,
      "text": "months ago now. We're up to about 15, 16,000 users and as for the future of Wanted."
    },
    {
      "s": 89.92,
      "e": 94.12,
      "text": "The future is looking very exciting. We're having a number of investor conversations with some"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.12,
      "e": 99.88,
      "text": "well-known investors. I probably don't want to say too much about that just don't want to jinx it"
    },
    {
      "s": 99.88,
      "e": 102.42,
      "text": "but yeah we've got plenty of opportunities. It's very exciting."
    }
  ]
}
